  "kind": "phrase",
  "headword": "think of",
  "star": true,
  "senses": [
    {
      "zh": "想起；想到"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Will you "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "think of"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " me after I’ve left?"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我离开之后，你会想我吗？"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "think of 是常考词组，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要知道：What do you think of 与 How do you like 意思相同，可以互换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如："
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "What do you think of"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " your new job? = "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "How do you like"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " your new job?"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "你觉得你的新工作怎么样？"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
